  "definitions_zh_TW": [
    {
      "text": "助詞。置於語尾，表示疑問的語氣。[例]幹麼",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "0531",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "→么麼",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "0545",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.助詞。表示有所斟酌的語氣。[例]要幫他麼，又想到他是那麼可恨；不幫他麼，又覺得他是那麼可憐。\n2.詞尾。[例]甚麼、這麼、那麼",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "0579",
      "verbatim": true
    }
  ],
